  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Harare Team Operating Costs (LPPZ Year 4)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is to support the CAFOD Harare southern Africa team to be able to support the four partners that are implementing the Livelihoods Protection and Promotion programme (Year 4). The goal of the programme is to improve household food security and reduce water borne diseases for 8,000 selected HH through a combination of broad interventions that include agriculture support, water and sanitation and social protection in Bulilima, Binga, Mangwe, Nyanga and Chivi by August 2012</narrative>
  </description>
